WEBVTT

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.360
Robin!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:17.120
I wield lavish justice to save
the people of the world!

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.120
D.D. Esper Robin has arrived!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.750
I traveled distant dimensions
in order to defeat you!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.670
Robin!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:32.130
How dare you oppose my
master Dark Emperor Dead Max!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.770
I wield justice!

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.510
Surprise Punch!

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.390
It can’t be!

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.730
Galaxy Queen is my mother
who I’ve been searching for!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.730
Robin, take Dead Max’s Curse!

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.900
Now you must obey me!

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.320
Be quiet!

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.320
I’m sleeping!

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.170
Yuma!

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.900
What is it?

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.500
That boy named Robin came
from a different world, just like me.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.140
What are you talking
about? It’s just TV.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:13.960
TV?

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.380
It’s haction.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.700
Haction?

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.960
Anyway, he’s—

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.640
Be quiet!

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.060
Fine, I’ll turn it on!

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.270
The next episode is
“Steamy Battle! Robin Forever!”

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.850
All right!

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:32.190
It’s kattobing time!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.420
Who should I duel?

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.110
Yuma, let’s go home.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.410
Why?

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:42.330
I must see what happens
to Robin today.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.330
If he really arrived through a dimensional fissure,
he may know something about my missing memories.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.340
What are you talking about?

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:56.260
I said that was haction!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.090
Hey Yuma, did you hear?

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.210
About what?

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.300
Robin is nearby!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.890
What?

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:07.600
They’re filming at a set
in the seaside district!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.950
Let’s go!

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.260
I can’t get enough
of that bad-boy image!

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.320
Robin!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.780
I must also meet Robin.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.310
Robin sounds fun,
but I want to duel—

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.910
Let’s go, Yuma!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:25.950
Let me duel!

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.670
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.800
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.720
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:45.140
Freedom begins by accepting differences
Dance and create the universe

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:51.270
In truth, I was sad until I met you

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:56.880
I lied, thinking it was easier to be alone

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:03.450
Even though we don’t like the same books or hobbies

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:07.330
You’re the only one who agreed with me

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.460
Joy and sadness and anger and do re mi fa so la ti do

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.960
There’s no harmony and scenario without differences

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:16.460
Everyone is not the same

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:20.550
That’s the reason for living

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:25.810
Even if the sounds are dissonant at times

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:31.730
That’s why I never give up
I believe my strength will get me through

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.080
I travel to the edge of the world

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.940
The sights I see with you are the truth

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.990
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:45.030
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.410
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.540
Freedom begins by accepting differences
Dance and create the universe

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.050
He’s really popular!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:05.720
Lavish Justice! Esper Robin Arrives!!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:05.720
Number 7:

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:05.680
Lavish Justice! Esper Robin Arrives!!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.180
Robin!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.760
We won’t be able to meet him.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.140
It seems you’re in trouble.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.100
Let me handle it.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.560
The world is full of
secret techniques.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.020
Normal people act nervous,
so they look suspicious.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.400
If you walk in boldly, you look like
someone who works in the industry!

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.950
Thanks!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.950
Had sushi at Roppongi.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.290
Then hung out past
midnight in Ginza.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.660
What are you talking about?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.920
Now!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.880
Don’t you know who I am?
Let me through!

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:40.800
I can’t believe it!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.690
Robin is here!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.440
Prepare yourself, Dark Emperor Dead Max!

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.960
That’s Robin’s voice!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.770
Take that!

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.080
There’s Robin!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.940
It’s really him!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:07.910
Dark Emperor Dead Max,
I’ll finish you today!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.090
Dark Emperor Dead Max...

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.370
Is that my enemy?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.480
Be careful, Yuma!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.120
Dead Max’s minion is right there!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.440
This is a costume.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.730
Costume?

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:23.250
It’s not real.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.970
Yuma!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.890
Yuma, you can fly?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:36.930
Does it look like I’m flying?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:40.980
I’m gonna fall!

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.280
I’m in trouble!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.660
How did you get in here?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.780
Come with me
to the security room!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.580
You’re a duelist.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.730
Is this your deck?

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.200
Huh?

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.050
That was close!

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.190
I dropped my deck case!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.930
The deck is a duelist’s life...

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.940
Unbelievable.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.160
Thank you! You saved me!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.180
There’s no need to thank me.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.770
But I have a request.

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.000
Request?

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.180
Have a lavish duel with me!

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.180
You like to duel?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.480
Yeah, a bit.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.380
Then let’s duel right now!

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.000
Really?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.030
Ahem, that’s not how I talk.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.050
Are you speaking the truth?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.360
Yeah! I’m Yuma Tsukumo!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.650
Let’s start the duel!

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:56.630
Yuma, instead of dueling,
ask him if he knows me.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:07:00.730
He doesn’t know you!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.180
What’s wrong?

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.480
That!

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.860
It’s just a spider.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.570
I hate bugs.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.570
What?

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.990
Please do something about that spider!

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.650
Where’s Yuma?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.170
You’re safe now.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.890
Thank you for saving me.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:38.130
What’s with you?

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:40.740
You’re supposed to be a hero,
but you’re afraid of a spider?

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:46.340
This is an illusion
that others created.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.820
I’m not as strong as Robin
nor am I brave.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:54.620
I’m a coward that can’t
even touch a spider.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.500
But they created this image...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:03.170
I’m tired of always having to act like
the Robin that they see on TV.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.190
But...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.710
No one tries to get to
know the real me.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.340
I don’t really understand, but...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.300
Just show your true self!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.310
Really?

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.020
Thank you.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:23.060
You’re the first person
who ever said that!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.770
Be my friend!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.230
My name is Fuya Okudaira.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:29.940
Fuya?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.260
Of course, Fuya!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:35.280
As a symbol of our friendship,
let’s have a duel!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:35.850
Yeah!

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:36.870
Robin!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.140
Who is that kid?

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.330
Mother!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.740
Mother?

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:45.540
I told you that you’re not
allowed to talk to outsiders!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:50.590
That’s Galaxy Queen.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.930
I know, Mother.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.050
No, you don’t know!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:09:01.650
If the fans discover your true identity,
it’ll destroy the image we built!

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:04.440
Think how hard I worked
to make you a star!

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:10.150
You must always protect Robin’s image!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.460
Leave!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:13.560
Hey!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:17.870
If you tell anyone that you met Fuya,
I’ll sue you for trespassing!

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.030
Let me go!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.250
Leave immediately!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.520
Yuma!

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.750
Fuya, we’re friends!

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:31.460
So let’s duel sometime!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.300
It’s fine.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.100
I can’t promise that.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.220
No one can save me.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:52.780
It seems hard
to be a star.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.820
What’s going on?

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.280
Why does Robin call himself Fuya?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.900
Robin isn’t Fuya.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.380
Fuya is Robin.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.000
What?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.720
Robin is in haction.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.710
He’s a TV character,
so he actually doesn’t exist.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.420
Does that mean I was tricked?

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:17.200
Fuya is acting as Robin.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.830
Acting...

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.500
Then about me—

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.930
Like I said, he doesn’t
know anything about you.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:24.920
I see.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.980
What?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.690
Are you disappointed?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.360
You know what it’s like
to feel lonely?

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.820
What’s “lonely?”

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.570
It means to feel pain
because you’re alone.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.880
Alone...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.280
Does that mean Fuya feels pain?

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.750
He was looking for help.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.320
No one can save me.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.800
Who are you?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:44.120
You littered that can
without a second thought.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:47.890
You must be Dark Emperor
Dead Max’s minion!

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:52.190
Take my lavish justice!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.940
What are you doing?

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.970
You tried to run
over a cat!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:14.120
You’re also Dark Emperor
Dead Max’s minion!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.140
Take my lavish justice!

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:32.310
Witnesses say it was Esper Robin,
the hero of the popular TV series.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.270
Is he really doing this?

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.780
Someone is pulling a prank.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.900
There’s no way
Robin would do this!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.690
That’s right!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.860
Robin would never do this!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.330
Why do I have to help?

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.250
You’re willing to let me
go on patrol alone?

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:55.850
We have to prove
that Robin is innocent!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.790
That Robin is a fake!

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.040
You’re right.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.840
Because the real one
is a coward.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.460
What do you mean?

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:04.640
Nothing.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:06.680
Over there!

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.090
Right!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.000
Are you okay?

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.320
Yuma!

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.030
Stop!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.330
You!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.710
Yuma, stay away from me.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.010
Where’s the criminal?

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.300
I lost him.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.520
That was definitely Fuya.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.770
What’s going on?

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:59.190
Why would he do that?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.150
Discover the truth, Yuma.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.240
How am I supposed to do that?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.370
Fulfill your promise with Fuya.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.030
Duel against Fuya.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.630
He wanted to duel.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.660
A duel is a sacred ritual.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:21.130
Dueling allows duelists
to understand each other’s feelings.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.760
No one can save me.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:28.630
You’re right.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:33.120
Only you can save Fuya.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.150
Fuya.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.120
What are you planning
to do by being Robin?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:55.080
Yuma, you came even though I told you
to stay away from me.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.580
Do you know what you’re doing?

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.040
I have to meet my
mother’s expectations.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.710
Your mother?

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:08.220
I have to defeat
Dark Emperor Dead Max.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.680
Fuya?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:13.640
Because I’m the real...

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.700
...D.D. Esper Robin!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.190
Yuma, you still don’t understand?

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:28.650
I’m the real D.D. Esper Robin!

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:34.990
You must always protect Robin’s image!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.700
You’re still thinking about that!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.640
What’s going on, Yuma?

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:45.050
He thinks that he’s Robin.

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:45.920
What?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:51.430
In other words, his soul can’t return
from the haction world?

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:56.500
Just like you said, he may
have been in pain this whole time.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:03.100
The world is waiting
for my lavish justice!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.770
Stop, Fuya!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.440
Yuma, why are you interfering?

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:13.530
I know. You’re also Dark
Emperor Dark Max’s minion!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.610
Fuya...

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:17.120
No, I mean Robin!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.730
Duel me!

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:20.750
I’ll make you come
to your senses!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.920
I accept, Yuma!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.300
Duel Disk set!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.130
D-Gazer set!

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:35.240
AR System Link complete.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.980
I’m kattobing!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:45.690
Will my kattobing
or your lavish justice win?

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:46.940
Duel!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.290
Robin is...

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.500
It’s a Number mark!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.780
A Number strengthened
the darkness in his heart.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:09.460
It’s your fault that
problems keep happening!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.800
Here I go! My turn!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:12.970
I draw!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.380
I summon Beast Warrior Puma!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.000
Be careful, Yuma.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:27.150
Puma is Robin’s master
and an expert swordsman.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:30.560
I set one card
and end my turn!

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.150
Here I go! My turn!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.490
I draw!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.830
I summon Gogogo Golem!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.350
Go, Gogogo Golem!

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.210
Attack Puma!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.380
Gogogo Blow!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.140
You fell for it!

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:53.500
I activate the trap Trion Barrier!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:18:02.890
When I have three Triple Star Trions in my hand,
the attacking monster switches to defense position.

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:10.730
Then I can Special Summon
three Triple Star Trions!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.480
Come, Triple Star Trions!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.330
Lavish Special Summon!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.450
Three at once?

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.200
I set one card
and end my turn!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.710
My turn! I draw!

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.130
I Tribute Summon
by tributing two Trions!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:37.840
Appear, D.D. Esper Star Robin!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.770
Tribute Summon?

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.970
Tribute Summon.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:51.770
By tributing monsters on the field,
he can summon higher Level monsters.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:58.200
Robin had to tribute two monsters
to summon Level 10 Star Robin.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.950
Triple Star Trion’s effect activates!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:09.620
When Trion is used to Tribute Summon,
I can negate its effect to Special Summon it back to the field!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.540
Trion! Lavish resurrection!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.850
Then I activate Space Ration
from my hand!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:24.810
I can activate this card
when D.D. Esper Star Robin is on my field.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:28.770
I can draw two cards
from my deck!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:33.730
Then I overlay
three Level 1 Trions!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:37.610
With these three monsters,
I build the Overlay Network!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.110
Xyz Summon!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:45.240
Appear, Number 83: Galaxy Queen!

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.440
A Number appeared!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.980
Galaxy Queen!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.150
She’s a powerful enemy that controls Robin
and his friends with magic.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:26.520
I equip the Equip Spell,
Dead Max’s Curse on Galaxy Queen!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:35.380
With this card, Galaxy Queen can’t change
battle position nor can she be destroyed!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:41.130
I use one Overlay Unit
to activate Galaxy Queen’s effect!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:51.230
Galaxy Queen makes all my monsters indestructible
and deal piercing damage until my next turn!

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:55.350
I’ll give you power!

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.780
All monsters can deal piercing damage?

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.480
This is bad.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:07.180
If he attacks Gogogo Golem...

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:11.040
...if its ATK are greater than your DEF,
you take the difference as damage.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.750
Go, Beast Warrior Puma!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.710
Black Slash!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:24.550
When Gogogo Golem is in defense position,
it can’t be destroyed by battle once per turn!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.260
But you still take piercing damage!

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.100
Go, Star Robin!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.980
Lavish justice!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.940
Surprise Punch!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.950
I set one card.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.910
I end my turn.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:57.120
It seems my lavish justice is greater
than your kattobing.

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:02.450
It’s not over!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:05.630
My kattobing is greater than this!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.610
Let’s start the duel!

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:17.540
This week’s quiz:

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:21.010
How many monsters can you
Normal Summon in one turn?

00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:24.530
1, 2, or 3?

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:34.660
Today’s test is hard
Can’t avoid pleasure and temptation

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:39.960
I want to go home and watch TV
Recent cartoons are entertaining

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:54.260
Anyway, tests are hard
Language, math and English are especially hard

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:59.560
Average scores in science and social studies
I’m only good at P.E.

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:01.980
(Wait, Baby!) The expected

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.610
(What’s that, Baby!) Answers

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:07.280
(Wait a sec, Baby!) Remember them

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
(What are we!? Baby!) For who

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:13.420
Let’s say I wrote the correct answers on that sheet

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:18.120
Will that change the future a year or a decade from now?

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:23.360
The world I drew at the edge of dreams

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:28.170
Someday I’ll race in the sky

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.300
Nobody can threaten my heart

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:38.430
Nothing is correct!

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.080
Robin... I mean Fuya!

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:49.000
This Number is like your soul,
struggling against your mother’s curse!

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.630
He was alone.

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:52.900
Yuma, we brought his mother!

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:56.460
What? 8000 ATK?

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:59.500
We now have all the pieces
for victory. We’ll win.

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:02.500
I will break your curse!

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:10.050
Star Robin Forever

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:06.670
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZEXAL:
“Star Robin Forever”

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.050
I’m kattobing!

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:15.330
The answer is... one monster!

00:24:15.330 --> 00:24:25.060
But if you use a spell, trap or monster effect, you can summon two or more monsters!
